msgid "NetBird Overview"
msgstr "NetBird 概览"

msgid "NetBird is an open-source VPN management platform built on top of WireGuard, making it easy to create secure private networks."
msgstr "NetBird 是一个基于 WireGuard 的开源 VPN 管理平台，旨在轻松创建安全的私有网络。"

